WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:01.150
(audience screaming)
- [Lea] You guys just--

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.260
- [Lea] I was backstage!

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:04.660
- Here's what's great,
it's the first season, Lea.

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:05.980
- So we don't have any money.
- Oh my gosh!

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:09.980
- So apparently we can only
snow in certain places,

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:11.400
and they're getting dumped on!

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:15.200
- I saw! It was so funny
because I have a funny story,

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.720
when I was on Glee, I
did a song from Frozen.

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:21.410
And we had the fake snow,
and it was like really heavy.

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:23.327
And I looked up during
the song, being like,

00:00:23.327 --> 00:00:24.600
"Wow, this is a lot of snow,"

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.490
and choked on the fake snow.

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:27.700
- No, that's actually happened to me.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:29.060
- In the middle of the performance.

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:30.930
And then it got really messy

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.210
and we were filming in slo-mo

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:34.186
and they got the entire thing on camera.

00:00:34.186 --> 00:00:35.550
- Oh!
- If you know what I mean.

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:37.380
- So, my sympathies just--
- That's awesome.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.120
- This is a lot.

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:39.953
Anyways.

00:00:39.953 --> 00:00:41.980
- That's actually funny,
I have choked on fake snow

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:42.830
in a performance before.

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:44.313
This must be a thing for singers.

00:00:44.313 --> 00:00:45.290
- You gotta be careful.

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:46.123
- You gotta get it out of the mouth.

00:00:46.123 --> 00:00:46.956
- Just zip it.

